    <string name="setup_title">Set up Flatdroid</string>
    <string name="setup_intro">Flatdroid downloads Alpine Linux, then installs Flatpak, a display server (Xvnc and Openbox) and PulseAudio into it. This downloads about 140 MB and needs about 400 MB of storage. Setup continues in the background and resumes if it is interrupted.</string>
